# Interactive glass

Tappable controls use **`@/lib/interactive-glass`** only:

- `interactiveGlassFlushClass`, `interactiveGlassRowClass`, `interactiveActionClass`
- `staticGlassFlushClass` — editing shells (non-tappable)
- `interactiveFeedbackClass` — feedback-only rows

Material + `userFeedbackClass` on **one** element.

## Do not in components

- Import `userFeedbackClass` from `@/lib/user-feedback`
- Import `glass*Class` / `actionClass` from `@/lib/surfaces` (use interactive-glass helpers)

CI: `npm run a11y:interactive`.

Allowlist: `lib/interactive-glass.ts`, `lib/surfaces.ts`, `Surface.tsx`, `icon-button-classes.ts`.
